# Kiến trúc Hệ thống — BookEase (Fullstack Mini SaaS)

> Domain: **BookEase** — đặt lịch dịch vụ (spa/salon/clinic mini). Theme B trong `04-project-themes.mdc`.
> Entity chính: `User`, `Service`, `TimeSlot`, `Booking`.
> 3 kỹ năng nâng cao: **Push Notification** (expo-notifications + FCM), **Deep Link** (Expo Router linking), **WebSocket/Real-time** (Supabase Realtime / SSE).

## 1. Thành phần

### A. Backend & Web Admin — NextJS (App Router)
- **Vai trò:** Admin dashboard (Web) + REST API (`/api/v1/...`) cho Mobile.
- **Stack:** NextJS 14+, TypeScript, Tailwind, shadcn/ui, TanStack Query, Zustand, Prisma.
- **Hosting:** Vercel (free).

### B. Mobile App — React Native (Expo)
- **Vai trò:** End-user app gọi API từ NextJS.
- **Stack:** Expo, TypeScript, Expo Router, TanStack Query, SecureStore.
- **Test local:** Expo Go / simulator.

### C. Database
- PostgreSQL trên **Neon.tech** hoặc **Supabase** (free tier).

### D. Observability
- **Firebase Crashlytics** — crash mobile (free, unlimited).
- **Firebase Analytics** — event cơ bản (free).
- **Sentry** (optional) — web + source map.

## 2. Data Flow

```text
[ Web Admin ]              [ Mobile App ]
      \                        /  ▲ deep link mở booking/[id]
       \   REST /api/v1/*    /   │ push notif (expo-notifications + FCM)
        v                    v   │
         [ NextJS Route Handlers ]
                  |
            [ Prisma ORM ]
                  v
         [ PostgreSQL Cloud ] ──► [ Supabase Realtime / SSE ]
                                        │ slot/booking đổi → đẩy event
                                        ▼
                              client invalidate React Query cache
```

